	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quemadmodum heri in literis meis tibi, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>charissime frater, exposui, totum negotium ex literis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tuis collectum retuli ad d. consulem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Is hodie recita<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ri curavit in frequenti et amplissimo senatu.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Visum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>est huic mittere ad vos <persName ref="p20814">Florinum hunc Gersterum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>civem nostrum.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Iussit, huic dem literas ad te <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>et ad d. <persName>Tscharnerum</persName>; <persName>Tscharnero</persName> adiunxi alterum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>consulem <persName ref="p2043">Ambrosium Martinum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Summa rerum, quae scribo <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>haec est: Intelligere fama dissidium ingens <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>propter duos episcopos inter vos et 2 Ligas, confoederatos <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>vestros, sententia iudiciaria pronunciasse pro Beato, Domum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>vero Dei provocasse ad ius, an ipsi debeant hac in <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>re pronunciare.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Futurum vero, ut hisce diebus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><persName>Beatus</persName> sit intrudendus; Domum contra Dei 5. die <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>maii comitia conscripsisse etc.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Et quamvis amplissimus <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>huius urbis magistratus paratus fuisset iam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ablegare duos legatos senatorios ad vos, quia <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>tamen varia sit fama, melius visum, ut <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>hic civis noster ad vos mittatur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Petere autem <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>amplissimum senatum, ut consules certa et quomodo omnis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>haec res habeat, scribant ad consulem nostrum; nostros <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>enim paratos esse ea, quae pacis sunt, quaerere <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>etc.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Haec summa est.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Tu vero, si quid hac <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>in re poteris consulere, facito.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quae rescrips<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>eris, fac, <placeName ref="l822">Germanice</placeName> scribas, ut nostri <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ea legere possint etc.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Totum negotium <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>quoque ad d. consulem perscripsi; hodie abit nuncius.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Ich hab och anzeigt, das an ettlichen enden man <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ußnäme, <foreign xml:lang="la">sicut ex tuis intellexi.</foreign></s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Vide[s] / vide[o] <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>nostros paratissimos esse ad pacificationem, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>quo belli occasio amputetur.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Optime vale.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Festinantissime scripsi; ursit enim questor <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>aerarius.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">4. maii 1566.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Tuus <persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">T<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>ui nulla feci mentionem, quod illa a te habeam; <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>proinde hac in re noli esse solicitus.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ministro fideli, domino <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>compatri et fratri meo <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>observando et dilecto.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
